---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
const pageTitle = "About";
---
<BaseLayout pageTitle={pageTitle}>
  <h2 class="page-subtitle">The Mission</h2>
  <p>
    Math, programming, physics, and everything in between can be incredibly challenging! Sometimes, the textbooks
    don't seem to make sense, and the professor's explanations feel like magic tricks. But I don't
    think it has to be that way, so I created this website in an effort to maybe make it a little
    easier to learn this stuff!
  </p>
  <p>
    The idea is simple: I'm going to post my notes, with explanations, on as many STEM-related
    subjects as I can. This website should prove a useful tool for anyone who needs a refresher
    or is struggling to understand a concept; it's meant to help speed up research. That being
    said, this website is not meant to replace textbooks or professors. It's just a resource.
  </p>

  <p>
    As well as providing free access to my notes, there is a community page where you can ask
    questions (anoymously if you want) and get answers from others, or pose ideas and get feedback.
    If you choose to be a part of this community, please be a decent human being and don't belittle
    people. Can't believe I have to say that.
  </p>

  <p>Thanks and enjoy! (^ - ^)</p>
</BaseLayout>